# Contributing to ${title}

You need GNU Make, curl, tar, sha256sum, python3, cpp, the MIPS binutils, splat (`pip install ${splat}`) and,
only for toolchains that assemble with it, armips. Tool commands default to conventional names. Put other paths in
`local.mk`.

Place your own big-endian cartridge dumps at these paths:

${roms}

`make` extracts each dump with splat, builds every version and verifies each ROM's SHA-1.
The compilers and the other pinned tools are downloaded into `tools/` and checked against their pinned hashes.
